WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.940
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.287
Building the Attribute-Driven Migration.

3
00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:11.887
This is Chapter 1: the middleware between
the H R extract and Microsoft Entra I D.

4
00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:15.619
The provisioning service will do
whatever the payload tells it,

5
00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:19.562
so the code that builds the payload
is where the H R record stays true.

6
00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:23.072
We'll start from Microsoft's
own sample, C S V to SCIM,

7
00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:28.637
see what it leaves to you, then walk the
hardened client, two labs and the dangers.

8
00:00:28.637 --> 00:00:33.840
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
